{"unit_id":"tag:0GJQ:proof","translation":"由于光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）仍光滑（smooth），只需证明光滑（smooth）态射（morphisms）局部无环（locally acyclic）。设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>的一个几何点（geometric point），其像（image）为<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的一个几何点（geometric point）。由于我们试图证明环映射（ring map）\n<MATH_0006>\n的一个性质（见定义<REF_0001>后的讨论），可以且确实将<MATH_0007>替换为基变换（base change）<MATH_0008>。因此可以且确实假设<MATH_0009>是严格亨泽尔（strictly henselian）局部环（local ring）的谱（spectrum），且<MATH_0010>位于<MATH_0011>的闭点（closed point）之上。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n我们将引理<REF_0002>应用于图（diagram）\n<MATH_0012>\n和层（sheaf）<MATH_0013>，其中<MATH_0014>，对于某个整数（integer）<MATH_0015>，它与<MATH_0016>的剩余域（residue field）的特征（characteristic）互素（prime to）。由光滑（smooth）基变换（base change），已知映射（map）\n<MATH_0017>\n是同构（isomorphism），见定理<REF_0003>（挠（torsion）的假设由<MATH_0018>的选取成立）。因此引理<REF_0004>给出\n<MATH_0019>\n中间的等式（equality）。对于外面的两个等式（equalities），使用<MATH_0020>。由于<MATH_0021>是可分闭（separably closed）域（field）的谱（spectrum），得出\n<MATHSEG_0001>若<MATHSEG_0002>若<MATHSEG_0003>\n，这正是所需证明的结论（见定义<REF_0005>后的讨论）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic","target_term":"局部无环"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"strictly henselian","target_term":"严格亨泽尔"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"spectrum","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"closed point","target_term":"闭点"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"integer","target_term":"整数"},{"source_term":"r